Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:29.43,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Saraba chikyuu yo, ai suru hito yo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:29.43,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Farewell Earth, and to the ones we love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:37.94,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.43,0:00:37.94,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato}Space Battleship Yamato
