Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.88,0:00:37.98,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFFFFFF&\fscx167\fscy142\c&H000000&\move(1490,872,1510,886,3,3840)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Chikyuu wo sukuu shimei o obite tatakau otoko
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:43.23,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Men fight on a mission to save Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Moeru roman
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.23,0:00:45.98,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{moeru roman}It's a burning passion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.32,0:00:52.63,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{dareka ga kore wo yaraneba naranu}Someone has to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.98,0:01:01.08,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{kitai no hito ga ore tachi naraba}We are the trusted ones
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ginga wo hanare Iscandar e harubaru nozomu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.82,0:01:08.42,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{ginga wo hanare iscandar e harubaru nozomu}Leaving the Milky Way to go all the way to Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Uchuu Senkan Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:15.44,def2,DUMMY,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{uchuu senkan yamato} Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:39.92,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}This is Acting Captain Kodai Susumu\Nof the space battleship Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.92,0:01:42.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&} I do not wish any further hostilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.53,0:01:45.03,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}I request that you quietly leave this space zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:47.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:49.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,That damn Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.38,0:02:06.07,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Without supplies or reinforcements, \Nfurther advancement is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.71,0:02:08.28,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Pursue the Yamato !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.30,0:02:14.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The Earth ship left us behind, \Nand alive, despite their victory !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.58,0:02:19.18,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{yatsu}We can't go on living or die without destroying it !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.02,0:02:26.76,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}{tatoe}Even if we burn in hell for acting against \Nthe Emperor's orders, we'll stop at nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:27.99,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,...to fight !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:36.98,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,His Majesty wishes to see your tenacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.60,0:02:42.53,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Great Emperor Zorder has told you as much...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:48.76,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,...but such human-like emotion acts as\Na deadly poison to those of Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:55.85,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,In fact, they began pursuing the Yamato\N on their own, out of sheer hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.93,0:03:01.72,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,They are a "contaminated" unit, which befouls the Great Emperor's flawless army.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:03.80,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,His Majesty wishes to eliminate...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:04.96,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Mr. Mill...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.10,0:03:10.43,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...I came here because I was \Ntold I could fight the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.99,0:03:12.53,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,That's a given.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:15.91,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,We trust that you will deal with the Yamato,\N the source of the contamination.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:20.52,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,My reason for existence is to\N report what I observe to the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.89,0:03:23.97,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Ten seconds to warp out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:28.47,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire the Desler Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:45.11,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,We Gatlantians prosper because we're\N not controlled by individual emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.91,0:03:51.52,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,To be honest, it's not so scary to \Nget deeply involved with humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:04:02.69,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Desler Cannon, energy charge 120%.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:06.37,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Things can turn devastating...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:13.65,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...when you get tossed around by emotion or love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:23.17,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Why ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.58,0:04:45.18,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,The contaminated unit was\N eliminated by Desler's fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:48.66,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,He has passed his first test.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:52.30,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,Is it because of his gratitude to His Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.05,0:04:56.52,def2,SABERA,0,0,0,,...or because he's realized \Nhe has no other place to be ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:59.89,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I don't think it's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.55,0:05:05.98,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,You had better watch carefully\N what makes a human so human.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.52,0:05:12.23,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Anti-matter ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:18.96,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,No, it's similar in behavior,\N but I'd rather call it unknown energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:24.68,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,And it was detected in Teresa's \Ncommunication wave the other day ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:29.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Yes. Plus an enormous amount of data that can be decoded by our technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:37.08,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Planet Telezart is surrounded \Nby complex gravitational waves. {spelling is matched to the screen from here on}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:41.72,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Beyond that, we've detected signs \Nof a heavily armed defense fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:46.69,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,And here's the actual shape computed just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:49.83,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.83,0:05:54.00,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Telezart is encased{enclosed} in crustal rocks with different properties.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:59.77,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{shitagatte}Therefore, it's reasonable to assume that those \Nwere brought there from different planets afterward.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.27,0:06:02.36,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,What kind of technology do they have ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.21,0:06:07.83,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Furthermore, enemy bases have been\N identified in multiple locations within those rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.83,0:06:09.29,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.29,0:06:15.38,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The planet itself is hollow, \Nand has a high energy signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:20.74,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's an unknown type of energy \Ncoming from an alternate dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:23.70,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Or, it could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.23,0:06:26.10,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Teresa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:28.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:32.49,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Even if we are able to meet, \Nwe won't be able to touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:33.35,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:35.48,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea of how to save her ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:40.69,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,The enemy's defense seems strong, \Nand landing on Telezart would be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:49.65,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We must act swiftly by combining the Yamato's firepower and air power with the Space Marine's mobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:54.18,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{touzen}Naturally, we should consider using\N the wave motion gun as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:07:01.00,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Deputy Commander, you said the\N unknown energy is decreasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.46,0:07:02.53,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:10.01,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,If those rocks surrounding Telezart are some kind of energy extraction system, it all makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:12.23,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Teresa's power is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.23,0:07:14.82,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,...being drained by Gatlantis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.59,0:07:18.39,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:21.39,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,How are you going to fight, Acting Captain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:45.63,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,What brought you here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:48.42,def2,KT,0,0,0,,You think I need{have} a reason ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.90,0:07:53.35,def2,KT,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about what \Nyou did to the Yamato's engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.51,0:07:59.24,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,Why did you stay on the Yamato ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.40,0:08:01.78,def2,KT,0,0,0,,This warmth...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:05.30,def2,KT,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is that ? Me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.40,0:08:16.33,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Enemy missiles from 4, 7, and 11 o'clock !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:18.38,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Anti-air combat. Activate guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.38,0:08:20.08,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers, engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.39,0:08:37.17,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,More missiles at 3 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:38.63,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Are we surrounded ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.63,0:08:39.57,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Any ships ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.57,0:08:40.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,None within range.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.76,0:08:44.93,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Use the attack vectors to calculate the \Nnumber of enemy ships and their coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:45.99,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Wave motion shield !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:51.53,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Concentration of missiles at 5 and 7 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.83,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Shima, all ahead full and pull away !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:58.12,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,This many missiles from outside our range ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.57,0:09:03.53,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Target speed is up by 70%.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.53,0:09:07.48,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Transposition area, expanding.\N Transposition paused.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:12.30,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Looks like that ship hasn't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.46,0:09:16.90,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Mr. Mill, I'll let you see \Nsomething interesting, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.09,0:09:20.87,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...continue your work on \Nfinding the Yamato's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:26.84,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Input new coordinates into the\N instantaneous transposition device.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:36.78,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Missiles from all directions !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:42.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,An attack from ahead ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:45.03,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,That's impossible. \NWe managed to pull away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:46.18,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Then, from another unit ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.79,0:09:48.68,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,That's a huge fleet !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:52.98,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The enemy must know the Yamato's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:59.33,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Incoming missiles from nearly all directions !\NWe're completely surrounded !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.65,0:10:02.43,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Acting Captain, status !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.82,0:10:04.55,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Calculating an escape route !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.63,def2,ANALYEZR,0,0,0,,Calculation complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.63,0:10:12.15,def2,ANALYEZR,0,0,0,,In 18 seconds there will be a six \Nsecond opening in the direction of 1:16.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:14.87,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,It could be a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:18.18,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Coordinates will be unstable at the warp exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:22.39,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Shima !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:23.53,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Steady !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.87,0:10:25.98,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Wave motion engine, maximum output.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:29.50,def2,TD,0,0,0,,Emergency warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.83,0:10:30.63,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Warp !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:38.06,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The target has entered warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.39,0:10:40.78,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Such a marginal window of opportunity...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:42.94,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,It still finds a way out of deadly situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.15,0:10:45.90,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,That's the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.43,0:10:52.38,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Warp complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:55.37,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,No contact on radar or scanners.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.19,0:10:59.22,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Hey, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:01.35,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Yeah, very familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.55,0:11:05.85,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We fell between dimensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:18.88,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Pops, the wave motion factors\N have been excessive{too good} since we arrived !{from a while ago.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:21.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The energy conversion rate is rising rapidly !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:22.88,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.88,0:11:25.43,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Is the pressure damper malfunctioning ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:26.23,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Check it !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:28.68,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.68,0:11:31.38,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{Engine }Chief, please shut down the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.38,0:11:32.20,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:34.20,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,At this rate, the Yamato will...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:37.11,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Stop the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:38.32,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Stopping the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:46.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Remains of a super nova ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.48,0:11:49.14,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,This space is filled with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:55.03,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,These elemental particle reactions are caused by the high energy of accelerated electrons and protons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.07,0:12:00.18,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The wave motion engine \Nlimitlessly takes in energy from space.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:03.34,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,If it continues the energy conversion...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:08.31,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,...the Yamato will be destroyed\N by an internal explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:15.63,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Are we drifting inside an \Nammunition depot, so to speak ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:19.47,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Enemy contact ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:20.43,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I can't confirm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.72,0:12:23.70,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,The enemy can use their radar ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:27.13,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{Engine} Chief, the sub engine should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:27.96,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.65,0:12:31.13,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Nanbu, load the aft torpedo tubes !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.13,0:12:33.98,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Fire diversionary torpedoes\N on the Acting Captain's mark !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:34.84,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.51,0:12:37.97,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Shima, evasive maneuvers. \NTurn starboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:43.32,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.10,0:12:58.58,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Internal engine pressure \Nrising at an accelerated pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.58,0:13:00.15,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Lascaux class ships are \Nexperiencing this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.15,0:13:02.48,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Bombardment is risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.48,0:13:03.78,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Let them continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.13,0:13:08.26,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:15.26,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Your trick seems to nullify both \Ndistance and spatial obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.58,0:13:18.65,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,That's what the cosmo wave is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:23.63,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, I haven't had\N any trouble finding the Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.63,0:13:24.88,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.07,0:13:31.94,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,A high-dimensional communication using telepathy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:37.87,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I believe that's what Teresa's \Nprayer is called. Am I right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:42.46,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}They can attack normally in this space ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:44.79,def2,KATSURAGI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Why don't you respond ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:52.48,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,What is this ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.75,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,Enemy fire is missing the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.16,0:14:08.36,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Internal explosion due to \Nexcessive energy conversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:15.25,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Like Emperor Zorder, \Nyou're unique as a Gatlantis person.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:19.25,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,As is the spy, who is aboard the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:26.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,That tubular planetary body is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.82,0:14:29.62,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,...clearly artificial.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:32.19,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Of an unknown species again ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:36.85,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,No, the style is similar to Archelian design.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.83,0:14:43.48,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,If it is an Archelias design, we have \Na good chance of making use of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:44.50,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,It's still a gamble, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:49.52,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Veer the Yamato into the tubular planetary body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:06.83,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,That must be the core of this space.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.12,0:15:11.87,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Having a problem using\N your cosmo wave, I presume ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:20.49,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Since your proud trick no longer works, let me\N try something a little more conventional, Mr. Mill.{a fair way.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.66,0:15:22.70,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,What will you do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.49,0:15:26.04,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,We'll use our eyes to search.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:38.93,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:42.46,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Your telepathy won't reach the Great Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:50.60,def2,SAITO,0,0,0,,Feels like we've entered a sausage tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.76,0:16:02.98,def2,OHTA,0,0,0,,This planetary tube's dimensional hierarchy\N appears to be different from that of the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:06.28,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Is that even possible ?{Could that be possible ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:11.52,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,So, the two spaces are fused seamlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.70,0:16:18.90,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Deputy Commander, if that's the case, \Ncan we get back to normal space ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:21.24,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Yes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.87,0:16:34.78,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Gatlantis's unique philosophy and all \Nits{those} technology is simply impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.23,0:16:36.23,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:41.96,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...which of the Emperor's\N subordinates truly understand him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:45.32,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{kimitachi}They may be the source\N of contamination to your people...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:49.95,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{kare}...but they could also be poisonous liquor with a mesmerizing aroma, or a favorite toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.73,0:16:54.88,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The Emperor probably doesn't \Nwish to destroy the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:17:00.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The Yamato and its crew must be a source\N of amusement he hasn't had in some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.46,0:17:13.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The Emperor knew from the beginning\N that the Yamato means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.37,0:17:21.56,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I'll keep this gun, Mr. Mill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.16,0:17:30.68,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Release the wave motion energy in this space, which will then \Ncreate a radiant heat that the wave motion engine can take it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.68,0:17:32.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Induction of radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.23,0:17:34.37,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Use this hollow structure to warp ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:37.88,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,One mistake and the ship will explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.88,0:17:43.40,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,It's like using an explosive\N to jump start the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.07,0:17:47.38,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,The {Engine}Chief and I will each \Nhave to shoulder half the responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:49.28,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,No, everyone will...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.23,0:17:52.50,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{Everyone will} ...bear the responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.69,0:17:59.96,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We can't waste time in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.66,0:18:10.98,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,You planned this all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.63,0:18:15.46,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,You lured it in here to cut off our telepathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:19.98,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I am a man who never forgets humiliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.73,0:18:25.13,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,You know the consequence\N of using that in a place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.13,0:18:28.18,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,It will light up this space...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.18,0:18:31.83,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,...as well as the Yamato and the\N fleet the Emperor entrusted to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.83,0:18:32.71,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,Desler !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:37.68,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Watch carefully.\N It's your job, isn't it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:49.58,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Extra dimensional implosion detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:51.38,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Why ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.15,0:19:01.11,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,The approaching wave motion energy is colliding with this space to create a shock wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.48,0:19:05.63,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Kodai, release the gravitational \Nanchor and ride the shock wave !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.63,0:19:08.78,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,The Yamato should be able to\Nwarp without the wave motion engine !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.16,0:19:11.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Roger. \NShima, can you ride the wave ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.06,0:19:15.66,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Reflectivity inside the tube is unstable.\N I'll aim for the center of radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:17.78,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Radiant induction wave approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.61,0:19:20.52,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Inertial canceler to maximum !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:25.42,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's made contact aft, and it's pushing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.97,0:19:28.07,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Open all intake valves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:30.64,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,All hands, prepare for warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:31.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Three...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.98,0:19:32.98,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,...two...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.98,0:19:33.60,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,...one...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.14,0:19:35.89,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,Warp !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.81,0:19:51.60,def2,COMPUTER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}The Yamato jumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.16,0:19:53.83,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Incredible luck as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:07.75,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:20.67,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Without the core, this alternative space will vanish soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:24.42,def2,MILL,0,0,0,,What're you doing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:31.63,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,Mr. Mill, aren't you happy to regain your \Ncosmo wave, now that this space has collapsed ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.99,0:20:44.93,def2,GENITZ,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Fuhrer, the entire army has\N been awaiting your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:49.68,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,I appreciate your continuous \Nloyalty from the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:53.99,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEEDB8&}Heil Desler.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:21:00.18,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,That's my real fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.68,0:21:04.99,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,The Great Emperor will eventually become aware of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.81,0:21:11.90,def2,DESLER,0,0,0,,So, don't rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:16.38,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Won't you accept ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:21.43,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,We were caught in an enemy trap.\N I simply repaid my debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:23.23,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,But Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.23,0:21:26.39,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,The Acting Captain believes you're\N the right person to be the Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.39,0:21:30.28,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,“Everyone will bear...” Is that it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.48,0:21:34.23,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,When it comes to his own situation...{matter...}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.91,0:21:39.63,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,I understand your concern,\N but the wall Kodai's facing right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.63,0:21:41.88,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,He has to break through it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:46.35,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,{omae}If he appears to fall, you give him support.{ give him help.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.12,0:21:54.60,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,Your parents were helping each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.74,0:21:58.43,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,You can do that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:02.02,def2,HIJIKATA,0,0,0,,That's how humans have always lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.25,0:22:04.90,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.28,0:22:10.43,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,The data from earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.43,0:22:14.18,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,We warped with an energy \Nthree times greater than normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:18.41,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,What caused the collapse of that alternate space ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.62,0:22:24.63,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,There are some abnormal neutron \Nbehaviors in the radiant implosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.63,0:22:25.61,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,That must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:28.80,def2,KEYMAN,0,0,0,,...the Desler Cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:44.78,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(220,866)}Episode 11
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:44.78,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(298,1044)}Challenge from Desler !
