Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.73,0:23:09.58,Karaoke Translation op,CAST2,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1334,118)}Ishizuka Unsho\NKaida Yuko\NYamadera Koichi\NKamiya Hiroshi \NTezuka Hideaki \NKaida Yuko\NUchiyama Koki\NUmetsu Hideyuki\NKiyama Shigeo\NKawai Toshiya\NYakamura Kotaro \NYano Masaaki
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:04.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Togire yuku manazashi wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.68,0:23:04.28,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{togire yuku manazashi wa}Your fading gaze turns to...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:08.39,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}...Yuuja no tashika na rashinban
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.28,0:23:08.39,def2,ENDSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}{yuuja no tashika na rashinban}...a trusted compass of a warrior
